,"speaker":"mast","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_82","text":"She hasn't even lifted a finger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_83","text":"The only thing I've seen she did is boss us around.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_84","text":"That's why people who come from royal backgrounds are no good. They think they're so much better than everyone else.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_85","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_86","text":"That's it. Due to insubordination, there is a ban on drinking, effective immediately.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_87","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_88","text":"If you don't clean the washrooms this instant, there'll be a ban on watching seagulls next.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_89","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_90","text":"You guys, when are you going to understand? The Aegis Squad must hold itself to the highest standard...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_91","text":"What standards? All we do is beg for handouts!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_92","text":"I'm so ashamed, I can't bear to tell anyone what I do!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_93","text":"So you're doing this job just for bragging rights?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_94","text":"Forget about boasting, we don't have an ounce of pride left! This isn't what I signed up for!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_helm_02_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_helm_02_95","text":"You said w